{"book":"alma","heading":{"en":"Religious freedom is proclaimed—The Lamanites in seven lands and cities are converted—They call themselves Anti-Nephi-Lehies and are freed from the curse—The Amalekites and the Amulonites reject the truth. About 90–77 B.C.","sm":"Ua folafola atu le saolotoga e tapuai ai—Ua faaliliuina sa Lamanā i laueleele ma aai e fitu—Ua latou ta'ua i latou lava o Aneti-Nifae-Liae ma ua tatala mai le fetuu—Ua tetee e sa Amalekā ma sa Amulonā le upumoni. E tusa o le 90–77 T.L.M.","words":[{"en":"·","sm":"Ua"},{"en":"·","sm":"folafola"},{"en":"is proclaimed","sm":"atu"},{"en":"·","sm":"le"},{"en":"·","sm":"saolotoga"},{"en":"·","sm":"e"},{"en":"·","sm":"tapuai"},{"en":"religious freedom—","sm":"ai—"},{"en":"·","sm":"Ua"},{"en":"·","sm":"faaliliuina"},{"en":"·","sm":"sa"},{"en":"The Lamanites are converted","sm":"Lamanā"},{"en":"·","sm":"i"},{"en":"·","sm":"laueleele"},{"en":"·","sm":"ma"},{"en":"in lands and cities","sm":"aai"},{"en":"·","sm":"e"},{"en":"seven—","sm":"fitu—"},{"en":"·","sm":"Ua"},{"en":"·","sm":"latou"},{"en":"They call","sm":"ta'ua"},{"en":"·","sm":"i"},{"en":"·","sm":"latou"},{"en":"themselves","sm":"lava"},{"en":"·","sm":"o"},{"en":"Anti-Nephi-Lehies","sm":"Aneti-Nifae-Liae"},{"en":"·","sm":"ma"},{"en":"·","sm":"ua"},{"en":"·","sm":"tatala"},{"en":"and are freed","sm":"mai"},{"en":"·","sm":"le"},{"en":"from the curse—","sm":"fetuu—"},{"en":"·","sm":"Ua"},{"en":"reject","sm":"tetee"},{"en":"·","sm":"e"},{"en":"·","sm":"sa"},{"en":"·","sm":"Amalekā"},{"en":"·","sm":"ma"},{"en":"·","sm":"sa"},{"en":"The Amalekites and Amulonites","sm":"Amulonā"},{"en":"·","sm":"le"},{"en":"the truth.","sm":"upumoni."},{"en":"·","sm":"E"},{"en":"·","sm":"tusa"},{"en":"·","sm":"o"},{"en":"about","sm":"le"},{"en":"90–77","sm":"90–77"},{"en":"B.C.","sm":"T.L.M."}]},"num":23,"verses":[{"en":"Behold, now it came to pass that the king of the Lamanites sent a proclamation among all his people, that they should not lay their hands on Ammon, or Aaron, or Omner,